  "description": "The meme references Barack Obama’s Kenyan heritage as a way to imply racial bias or to deflect responsibility. This is a real-world fact — Obama was born in Kenya — but the meme uses it in a misleading context to suggest that his race is somehow responsible for his actions or statements. This is a form of racial stereotyping that attempts to link a person’s identity to their behavior or responsibility.",
